00:04:13,627 --> 00:04:16,132
model. For example, fine-tuned versions that

99
00:04:16,132 --> 00:04:18,942
may be better at certain tasks and very

100
00:04:18,942 --> 00:04:20,836
important quantizations.

101
00:04:21,752 --> 00:04:24,449
And it's these quantizations that you wanna

102
00:04:24,465 --> 00:04:24,610
run

